<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukrainian naval drones have struck two Russian vessels at Libya's Benghazi naval base and off its coast, sinking one warship and damaging another. Libyan forces continue shelling Haftar positions while some Haftar militia have surrendered at a strategic airbase, and Turkish officials have publicly welcomed a motion supporting the troops. An armed group blocked the Hamada oil pipeline for over 20 days, causing $31 million in losses for the National Oil Corporation. The conflict still recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/23/un-mission-in-libya-urges-probe-after-russian-ship-hit-by-drones-off-benghazi&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOTzIzWjZLTEdiVXRtR0I1cEJ3MFVCUzF5ZktKdWRUQlNtMEVDTnQ4Mk5xU2tvODVlRUJFeE5KOGlieGxsYkp5c1dhZklONzRZNW1VWTR4OVM1MGFQM0cxRXBaQm93b1lhWG1qR3F0ZGV2VTRRRGxtbTRkU1VYQ2c2dEtHckpXQmJCbmpYZlNKeFVrNW8zVjBldDFEWGc1TmIzRTJTM0ozNy1yanVq?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/inside-story/2026/11/24/is-libya-a-new-front-in-the-ukraine-war?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/24/after-libya-where-will-ukraine-strike-russia-next?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/24/footage-of-russian-cargo-ship-hit-by-ukrainian-drone-attack-in-the-gulf-of-finland&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm894p88jzxpo?at_medium=RSS&amp;